            "id": "msg_ops0seq00003",
            "sender": "nova",
            "seq": 3,
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "why": "Drain page [1, 3] with seq 2 absent; seq 3 parks on the gap and the socket drops inside the gap window. The cursor stops at seq 1. The default mode drops the parked row unacked (the server re-offers it); ack_on_receipt hands parked frames to the handler at close."
    },
